WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:06.280
Investigate according to the names on the letters arrest them one by one.

00:06.360 --> 00:09.720
Punish by military law to warn the entire army.

00:09.800 --> 00:11.080
Yes.

00:11.160 --> 00:16.200
Your Highness Your Highness, spare us Your Highness, spare us Your Highness, spare us.

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
With Dongming secured, responses echoed from across the realm. Northern prefectures sent envoys pledging allegiance, signaling a turning tide for Great Xuan.

